'self' is the forced spike itself and should read about 1.
'gen 1' is what it caused one synapse later: that ratio is the
branching ratio. 'any?' is the fraction of source cells that caused
anything at all. 'drift' is how far two identical unperturbed runs
diverge over the same window -- the floor for all of this.

